# Missing hashed JS must 404. SPA fallback of /assets/* → index.html makes
# Bolt Publish races execute HTML as a module and the page stays blank.
# Do not 404 /src/* — Bolt preview serves the Vite entry /src/main.tsx.
/assets/*  /404.html  404

